#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:2077
msgid ""
"Your own theme: put a file such as sunset.json in {0}/themes. It appears under Theme by its name:\n"
"{{\"name\": \"Sunset\", \"base\": \"midnight\", \"colours\": {{\"wiiu\": \"#ff7a59\", \"ink-0\": \"#120806\"}}, \"corners\": 0.5, \"motif\": \"none\"}}\n"
"base: a theme to start from (light, link-jack, classic, midnight, eden). colours: ink-0 to ink-2 (the background), text, wiiu, n3ds, nds and nx (each system's), glass, line, good, warn, bad and focus, as #rrggbb. corners: 0 square to 1.5 round. motif: side, none or eden."
msgstr ""
"O teu próprio tema: um ficheiro como sunset.json em {0}/themes, lido quando a aplicação inicia e listado em Tema pelo nome:\n"
"{{\"name\": \"Sunset\", \"base\": \"midnight\", \"colours\": {{\"wiiu\": \"#ff7a59\", \"ink-0\": \"#120806\"}}, \"corners\": 0.5, \"motif\": \"none\"}}\n"
"base: um tema de partida (light, link-jack, classic, midnight, eden). colours: ink-0 a ink-2 (o fundo), text, wiiu, n3ds, nds e nx (os de cada lado), glass, line, good, warn, bad e focus, como #rrggbb. corners: de 0 reto a 1.5 redondo. motif: side, none ou eden."

#. {0} is Eden's data folder; {1} its game files folder (the same one unless another was chosen)
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:2081
msgid "Saves: {0}/user/nand/user/save. Updates and DLC: beside a game, in its own folder, or in {1}/updates. Mods and cheats: {1}/mods. Covers and names: {0}/covers."
msgstr "Gravações: {0}/user/nand/user/save. Atualizações e DLC: ao lado de um jogo, na pasta dele, ou em {1}/updates. Mods e batotas: {1}/mods. Capas e nomes: {0}/covers, depois de o Eden ler um jogo."

